@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<h1>EDI X12 Reader Application</h1>

<p>Welcome to the EDI X12 Reader - a web-based tool for parsing and viewing EDI X12 format files.</p>

<div class="alert alert-info" role="alert">
    <h4 class="alert-heading">Supported EDI Formats:</h4>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>837</strong> - Healthcare Claim (Professional, Institutional, Dental)</li>
        <li><strong>835</strong> - Healthcare Claim Payment/Remittance Advice</li>
    </ul>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h5 class="card-title">Get Started</h5>
        <p class="card-text">
            Navigate to the <strong>EDI X12 Reader</strong> page to upload and parse your EDI files.
            You can paste EDI content directly or use the sample files to see how it works.
        </p>
        <a href="/edi-reader" class="btn btn-primary">Go to EDI Reader</a>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="mt-4">
    <h3>Features</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>Parse EDI X12 format 837 and 835 files</li>
        <li>View segment-by-segment breakdown</li>
        <li>Display element data for each segment</li>
        <li>Sample EDI files included for testing</li>
        <li>Error handling for invalid EDI content</li>
    </ul>
</div>

